*.png
*.jpg
!og.png

# OG social cards are DELIVERABLES, not build noise. The blanket *.png above silently
# swallowed all nine on 2026-08-30: `git add -A` succeeded, the commit succeeded, the meta
# tags went live pointing at images that 404'd. Un-ignore them explicitly.
!og.png
!og/*.png

# showcase poster is a DELIVERABLE the hero video references; the blanket *.jpg would 404 it live.
!media/showcase-poster.jpg
